[38;2;124;124;124m$k[x,y]/(y^2 - x^3)$. The function $t = y/x$ (on the normalization) — is $y/x$ a[0m[38;2;124;124;124mregular function on $Y$?[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mOn $Y$, $y/x = y/x$. In the coordinate ring $k[x,y]/(y^2 - x^3)$, is $y/x$ an [0m
